WCC Canvas Ready
Copyright 2026 Chris Pasquini, Aaron Booker, and the WCC Canvas Ready contributors

Developed for Whatcom Community College (Bellingham, Washington).

This skill began as Chris Pasquini's `canvas-accessible-docx` skill
(v1, November 6, 2026; v3, November 13, 2026). Aaron Booker rebuilt it,
extended it to PowerPoint, Excel, PDF and HTML files, and tested it against
Whatcom Community College's YuJa Panorama. WCC colleagues contributed test
files.

